{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54993","headline":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 十七 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占怪第二十三（京本作「占怪象第十四」○四十四首） 十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军营内，地上艾方（京本作「蒿」）生。\n青嫩叶苗人尽识，师徒将捷（京本作「疾」）事非轻，恶疾使人惊。\n（七年之病，求三年之艾，故爲病兆。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}